# The API's own address, for the assistant only (the answer stream is called on it directly, ADR 0009).
# Leave unset in development: "/api" goes through the Vite proxy to http://localhost:3001.
# In production (Vercel) set it to the Railway address, without a trailing slash:
# VITE_CHAT_API_URL=https://stromblickapi-production.up.railway.app